cupies Pontus</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">66 BCE</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#pompey">Pompey</a> routs Mithridates on the Lycus river</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">63 BCE</span><span class="rf-text">Mithridates VI dies at Panticapaeum; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#pompey">Pompey</a> divides Pontus</span></li></ol>
